  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/97ecbf33-4d2b-4795-88b4-803c00ef25fc-9894050.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 79px;\" /></p><p>Average velocity of car is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Total&#160;displacement</mtext><mtext>Total&#160;time</mtext></mfrac></math></p><p>As the car is travelling along a straight line without turning, the magnitude of total displacement is same as the distance covered.&nbsp;</p><p>The time taken to cover the first half is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and the time taken to cover the second half is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
